      "remarks": "The obligation set that has applied to providers of general-purpose AI models since 2 August 2025. Article 55 applies only where the model is classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51; include it and record the classification determination either way. Article 50(2) is included because a provider of a general-purpose AI system generating synthetic content carries the machine-readable marking obligation independently of model classification. The Article 51(2) compute threshold is amendable by delegated act — verify the currently applicable value before relying on the pre-set parameter."
    },
